        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jooriischooda lugooda Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'ata ng'asheesu ghabwar Dawdi fuga Filisti ak ghwajoar, ak gageanda Dawdi Metagama aba geatinga fuga Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwajoar Moabu, ak goodeena saawa ghealooda nea nibwada jeesinga ng'eanyi, ak goodeen ghealooni iyeenya jea ghwanung' gameewa, ea ghealoanagi mughuush jea eapuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara Dawdi ghwajoar Hadadeseri was orjeeda Rehobu, sugoocheanda Soba, damanda beewa ghwanyasa gicha uurda aba eenda Furati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoareat Dawdi niny fih sagalama ea bughalaji ispwa ding'da faraasajeega, ea shirikaraji sagalamnyooji diktam badiina geeshanga; ak ghwalajaada Dawdi geeshanga faraasajeega sean angiir mutukwajeega, ak ghoabuut faraasaji bughala deay aba giingiir mutukwajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahidu fuga Shaamuyda Dameski ghaweat Hadadeseri was sugoocheanda Soba, ghabwar Dawdi fih sagalamnyooji diktam ea iyeenya bea Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiin Dawdi heeda jea eeratiisa buuneeda Shamooda Dameski; ak ghoah fuga Shaamu fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi nea gweadu haleanjeeda guskuseega. Ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdi jooriischooda aba hiji weah sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu Dawdi igeambooniga dahaabu ghayi eada fuga gadiyeeda Hadadeseri, ak gweadu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gidang'eada Beta ea Berotayi was mujiinajeega was sugoocheanda siguura Hadadeseri, gageanda sugoocheanda was Dawdi lagheanga saang'a oomng'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gwayiing'shi Doyi sugoocheanda Hamati gideaba nijoar Dawdi lugooda sean bea Hadadeseri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean goojeakta Doyi orjeedaanyi siguura Yoram gaweesa sugoocheanda siguura Dawdi, googeachi niny, nea gagwarsa nea gwayeesha gisini gidahit gideaba ging'ucheewi Hadadeseri ak gijoari; aba gideaba iimiisean gang'uchi Hadadeseri sea Doyi. Ak gweadu Yoram haleanjeeda lapiya, ea dahaabu, ea gea lagheanga oomng'i; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eara suh ghoadaw sugoocheanda was Dawdi NG'UTAMIIDA, sea lapiya ea dahaabooda ghayi adayda leabu eemoojiga sean ghayi joar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gea leabu Edomu, ea Moabu, ea Amoni, ea Filisti, ea Amaleki ea gea was haleanjeeda siyeasa Hadadeseri orjeeda Rehobu, was sugoocheanda Soba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' Dawdi gageawiit gheawungaaschi. Iimuchu nea gabiigu, ghabwar fih sagalamnyooji damasis bea Edomu aba mwangoachiyda Balang'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin heeda jea ghoah museasajeega lugweega aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Edomu; ak gwasissa jeeda ng'eanyiisean bea Edomu museasajeega lugweega, ak ghoah buuneesean bea Edomu fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi. Ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA Dawdi jooriischooda aba hiji weah sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goombal Dawdi Israeleesean; ak gwasissa Dawdi ng'asheega doobiiweadi nea ghwanung' gooyang'deay buuneesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yoabu orjeeda Seruya goombal lugooda; nea Yehoshafati orjeeda Ahiludi ea siida ng'oora askwearjoojiga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Sadoki orjeeda Ahitubu sea Ahimeleki orjeeda Abiyatari ea ashoohoodiga; ea Seraya ea siida ng'oorshachi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Benaya orjeeda Yehoyada goombal fuga Gereti ea fuga Beleti; nea orjooga Dawdi ea ashoohoodiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
